# A benchmark session keeps its report, metrics, verdicts, machine state and
# the game's own summary of every run; the raw captures behind them (per-frame
# profiles and frame times, GPU samples, run logs, screenshots, the HTML copy
# of report.md) stay beside them, uncommitted. The ones from before
# 2026-09-28 are at the tag benchmarks-raw-data.
bigame-engine/benchmarks/**/stdout.log
bigame-engine/benchmarks/**/stdout.log.*.csv
bigame-engine/benchmarks/**/session.log
bigame-engine/benchmarks/**/gpu.csv
bigame-engine/benchmarks/**/gpu-samples.csv
bigame-engine/benchmarks/**/nvidia.csv
bigame-engine/benchmarks/**/frames.csv
bigame-engine/benchmarks/**/*_frametimes_*.txt
bigame-engine/benchmarks/**/*.png
bigame-engine/benchmarks/**/report.html
bigame-engine/benchmarks/**/workload-config.original.xml

# Proprietary third-party binaries (Lossless.dll, DLSS/XeSS/FSR runtimes,
# OptiScaler) are never part of this repository.
*.dll
